; Port Connectivity Checks: "jtag_uart_tx:u_jtag|alt_jtag_atlantic:u_atlantic"                                                                                                      ;
+----------------+--------+----------+----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
; Port           ; Type   ; Severity ; Details                                                                                                                                      ;
+----------------+--------+----------+----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
; t_dat          ; Output ; Info     ; Connected to dangling logic. Logic that only feeds a dangling port will be removed.                                                          ;
; t_dav          ; Input  ; Info     ; Stuck at VCC                                                                                                                                 ;
; t_ena          ; Output ; Info     ; Connected to dangling logic. Logic that only feeds a dangling port will be removed.                                                          ;
; t_pause        ; Output ; Info     ; Connected to dangling logic. Logic that only feeds a dangling port will be removed.                                                          ;
; raw_tck        ; Input  ; Warning  ; Declared by entity but not connected by instance. If a default value exists, it will be used.  Otherwise, the port will be connected to GND. ;
; tdi            ; Input  ; Warning  ; Declared by entity but not connected by instance. If a default value exists, it will be used.  Otherwise, the port will be connected to GND. ;
; jtag_state_rti ; Input  ; Warning  ; Declared by entity but not connected by instance. If a default value exists, it will be used.  Otherwise, the port will be connected to GND. ;
; usr1           ; Input  ; Warning  ; Declared by entity but not connected by instance. If a default value exists, it will be used.  Otherwise, the port will be connected to GND. ;
; clr            ; Input  ; Warning  ; Declared by entity but not connected by instance. If a default value exists, it will be used.  Otherwise, the port will be connected to GND. ;
; ena            ; Input  ; Warning  ; Declared by entity but not connected by instance. If a default value exists, it will be used.  Otherwise, the port will be connected to GND. ;
; ir_in          ; Input  ; Warning  ; Declared by entity but not connected by instance. If a default value exists, it will be used.  Otherwise, the port will be connected to GND. ;
; tdo            ; Output ; Warning  ; Declared by entity but not connected by instance. Logic that only feeds a dangling port will be removed.                                     ;
